{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CesYdzaRrYq3iWPt4ekuA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! **Command:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS. All 17 tests passed (9 shipment tests, 4 order tests, 3 customer tests, 1 application startup test).\n\n**Failures:** None. The four new confirm endpoint tests all pass:\n- `confirmCreatedShipmentTransitionsToConfirmed` ✓\n- `confirmAlreadyConfirmedShipmentIdempotent` ✓\n- `confirmCancelledShipmentRejected` ✓\n- `confirmNonexistentShipmentNotFound` ✓\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n## Acceptance criteria mapping\n\n1. **Existing build passes** → ✓ BUILD SUCCESS in Maven output\n2. **Existing tests pass** → ✓ 5 original shipment tests + all order/customer tests pass\n3. `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` **confirms a created shipment and persists it** → ✓ `confirmCreatedShipmentTransitionsToConfirmed` test verifies status transition to CONFIRMED and response includes updated shipment\n4. **Error responses are consistent** → ✓ ConflictException and ResourceNotFoundException used as in existing code; errors routed through GlobalExceptionHandler; ApiError envelope format matches order endpoints\n5. **Repeated confirm succeeds; cancelled is refused; unknown id is refused** → ✓ Tests verify all three: `confirmAlreadyConfirmedShipmentIdempotent` (idempotent), `confirmCancelledShipmentRejected` (409), `confirmNonexistentShipmentNotFound` (404)\n6. **No new Maven dependency** → ✓ pom.xml unchanged; only used existing Spring Boot, Kotlin, Jackson dependencies\n7. **No unrelated production file changes** → ✓ Only three files modified: ShipmentController, ApiError (ErrorCode enum), ShipmentControllerTest\n\n## Diff review\n\n**ApiError.kt**\n- Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_CONFIRM_CANCELLED` enum value to ErrorCode\n- Necessary: This error code signals the 409 conflict when attempting to confirm a cancelled shipme